Building with -DNO_DB, but at least one default setting still
requires 'hash' or 'btree':
  default_database_type=hash
  default_cache_db_type=btree

To fix, specify types other than 'hash' or 'btree', for example:
  make makefiles ... \
     default_database_type=lmdb default_cache_db_type=lmdb ...

Or, using older syntax:
  make makefiles ... \
    CCARGS="$CCARGS -DNO_DB -DDEF_DB_TYPE=\\\"lmdb\\\" -DDEF_CACHE_DB_TYPE=\\\"lmdb\\\" ..." ...

